<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Times New Roman; " ALIGN="left">The reported earnings per common share calculations give retroactive effect to the issuance of the common stock
as of July&nbsp;25, 2022 and January&nbsp;1, 2023, issued in connection with the <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">spin-off</FONT> of the Company from Imperial Petroleum Inc. in June 2023. All share information also reflects the <FONT
STYLE="white-space:nowrap"><FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">1-for-100</FONT></FONT> reverse stock split of the Company&#146;s common stock effected at 11:59 p.m., Eastern Time, on April&nbsp;11, 2024. </P></TD></TR></TABLE>
